\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Summary of main results. \textit  {Panel\nonbreakingspace (a):} cumulative regret decomposed by phase under reward drift (Exp.\nonbreakingspace 2; 40\nonbreakingspace seeds, $\lambda _s{=}0.20$). \textit  {Panel\nonbreakingspace (b):} Phase\nonbreakingspace 1 budget utilisation under cost drift (Exp.\nonbreakingspace 3; 50\nonbreakingspace seeds). Utilisation\nonbreakingspace $=$\nonbreakingspace realised cost\nonbreakingspace /\nonbreakingspace target\nonbreakingspace $B$; values near $1.0\times $ indicate precise budget control. All pairwise differences in\nonbreakingspace (a) are significant after Holm--Bonferroni correction ($p < 10^{-6}$).}}{6}{table.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
